// The truth of the fair set (S66) for Theodore Lack, Myosotis (Feuillet d'album) Op.148: written from the Heugel print
// (1890, IMSLP #45177, data/fair/lack148/heugel), bar by bar. Never to debug the reader on.
// As the print has them: heads on and above ledger lines named by counting the ledger lines (a line through the head
// or under it; tools/fair-truth/ledger.py), not by the head's measured centre; bars 60-61 under an 8va line (written
// here as they sound); the "M.G." grace runs and chords of bars 56, 67 and 68 written in the staff they are printed in
// (grace notes are not scored); bars 41-44 have A-flat, not D-flat, under the left hand (unlike bars 1-16).
